The '''Mount Quidamortem bank''', more commonly known as the '''Cox bank''' or '''raids bank''', is a [[bank]] located on [[Mount Quidamortem]]. It is typically used for players preparing for the [[Chambers of Xeric]], as well as for those preparing to fight [[Vardorvis]].

